[F#m] si tú no me [Bm]quieres me [E7]voy a mo[A]rir
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[A] Vamos a [F#m]cantar yo y [Bm]tú... [E7]↓  [A]↓
{end_of_verse}
